id: pm-2cv2o1
title: Refresh transitive brace-expansion and PostCSS patches for 2026-08-03 audit advisories
description: "A fresh pnpm audit found GHSA-rgw5-rvv9-x895 in brace-expansion 5.0.8 through ESLint/minimatch and GHSA-fxqj-rqcc-2cmp in postcss 8.5.22 through Vite/Vitest. GitHub alert APIs currently report zero open alerts, so the lockfile must be refreshed directly to patched versions and verified with the complete release/security gate."
type: Issue
status: in_progress
priority: 0
