severity: high
expected_result: "pnpm audit reports zero vulnerabilities and all repository quality, coverage, packaging, npm, and Bun acceptance gates remain green."
actual_result: "pnpm audit reports one high and one moderate transitive vulnerability while GitHub Dependabot, code-scanning, and secret-scanning APIs each report zero open alerts."
